### Customer Profile Management API Testing

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = your_jwt_token_here
@userId = 1

### 1. Get Complete Customer Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customer/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "user": {
#     "userID": 1,
#     "name": "Sakna Rajapakshe",
#     "email": "sakna@gmail.com",
#     "phone": "07X-XXXXXXX",
#     "address": "Galle, Sri Lanka",
#     "loyaltyPoints": 125
#   },
#   "vehicle": {
#     "vehicleID": 1,
#     "plateNumber": "CAC-4455",
#     "model": "Toyota Axio",
#     "company": "Toyota",
#     "year": "2017",
#     "vin": "XYZ999999"
#   },
#   "upcomingAppointment": {
#     "appointmentID": 223,
#     "serviceTitle": "Full Service",
#     "date": "2025-03-10T10:15:00",
#     "time": "10:15",
#     "status": "In Progress",
#     "progressPercentage": 65,
#     "appointmentType": "Service",
#     "employeeName": "John Mechanic"
#   },
#   "serviceHistory": [...],
#   "projects": [...]
# }

### 2. Update Customer Profile (Name, Phone, Address)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customer/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sakna Rajapakshe",
  "phone": "0771234567",
  "address": "123 Main Street, Galle, Sri Lanka"
}

### 3. Update/Add Vehicle Information
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customer/{{userId}}/vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "Toyota Axio",
  "year": "2017",
  "vin": "1HGBH41JXMN109186",
  "plateNumber": "CAC-4455",
  "company": "Toyota"
}

### 4. Get Loyalty Points Only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customer/{{userId}}/loyalty
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Add Loyalty Points (Admin/Employee Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customer/{{userId}}/loyalty/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "points": 50
}

### 6. Get All Customers (Admin Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Profile/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### Authentication Endpoints (from AuthController)
### ============================================

### 7. Register New Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Customer123!",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### 8. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

### Response will include:
# {
#   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
#   "refreshToken": "guid-string",
#   "role": "Customer"
# }
